AISEO production runbook

Production runtime uses Supabase Postgres, Redis/BullMQ workers, GSC, DataForSEO,
WordPress, and an immutable TRC20 USDT credit ledger.

Before deployment run: npm ci; npm run prisma:generate; npm run lint;
npm run test:coverage; npm run build.

Copy .env.example into the deployment secret manager. Never expose Supabase
service-role, GSC, DataForSEO, TronGrid, or WordPress credentials to browsers.

To verify local Supabase migrations: npx supabase@2.81.3 start; npm run
supabase:push; npx supabase@2.81.3 test db.

Before production: link the approved Supabase project, rotate historical
credentials, verify restore from backup, smoke-test staging integrations and
confirmed TRC20 transfers, then complete the relevant USDT legal review.
